    ["ESO automatically converts duplicate collectibles into Crown Gems.\nCodex records the gems reported when a crate is opened.\nCodex does not exchange items for you.\nManual Gem Extraction is separate and is not included here.\nOld Tracker history did not record duplicate-conversion gems.\nNot recorded means unknown, rather than zero."] = "ESO 会自动将重复收藏品转化为王冠宝石。\nCodex 记录开启宝箱时游戏报告的宝石数量。\nCodex 不会替你兑换任何物品。\n手动宝石提取是独立操作，不计入此处。\n旧 Tracker 历史没有记录重复收藏品转化的宝石。\n「未记录」表示未知，并非零。",
    ["%d fully classified of %d eligible openings.\n%d top-tier reward cards cannot yet be split reliably into Apex or Radiant Apex.\nUnresolved openings are excluded from rarity percentages instead of being assigned to the wrong group. Item and bonus rates still retain eligible openings."] = "%d / %d 次符合条件的开启已全部分类。\n%d 张最高等级奖励卡牌尚无法可靠区分为巅峰或光辉巅峰。\n未确认的开启记录不会被错误分组，而是从稀有度百分比中排除。物品和额外卡牌统计仍保留符合条件的开启记录。",
    ["General purchased-crate reference: Common 98%, Fine 72%, Superior 86%, Epic 21%, Legendary 14%, Apex including Radiants 2%. Not per-card rates; not validated for every special crate. Unknown tiers are excluded from rarity percentages. Imported gems were not recorded. Personal samples do not predict the next reward."] = "已购买宝箱的一般参考：普通 98%、优良 72%、精良 86%、史诗 21%、传说 14%、巅峰（含光辉巅峰）2%。这些不是单张卡牌概率，也未经所有特殊宝箱验证。未知等级不计入稀有度百分比。导入记录未记录宝石。个人样本不能预测下一次奖励。",
    ["For the Crown Crate version; potential value, not gems earned."] = "仅适用于王冠宝箱版本；这是潜在价值，不是已获得的宝石。",
